ve, Educational, and Student Support (AESS) unit assessment is a systematic process of collecting, analyzing, and using information to improve unit functions, roles, and services as defined in its mission, goals, and outcomes. It measures Student Learning Outcomes and Operational Outcomes.","url":"\u002Finstitutional-effectiveness\u002Fassessment\u002Fnon-academic","items":[]},{"title":"Assessment Spotlights","description":"Highlighting assessment activities in Academic Programs and Administrative, Educational, and Student Support Units","url":"\u002Finstitutional-effectiveness\u002Fassessment\u002Fassessment-spotlight","items":[]},{"title":"Assessment Workshops & Celebrations","description":"Academic, General Education, and AESS Unit Workshops","url":"\u002Finstitutional-effectiveness\u002Fassessment\u002Fworkshops","items":[]},{"title":"General Education Program Assessment","description":"General education assessment is the systematic and continuous process of collecting and analyzing empirical data in order to improve general education student learning outcomes (SLOs).","url":"\u002Finstitutional-effectiveness\u002Fassessment\u002Fgeneral-education-assessment","items":[]},{"title":"Institutional Effectiveness Annual Reports","description":"Annual institutional Effectiveness reports highlight activities of the three college-wide assessment committees: Academic Assessment Committee (AAC); General Education Assessment Committee (GEAC); and Administrative, Educational, and Student Support Assessment Committee (AESSAC)","url":"\u002Finstitutional-effectiveness\u002Fassessment\u002Freports","items":[]},{"title":"Institutional Effectiveness Committee (IEC)","description":"Committee Charge and Membership","url":"\u002Finstitutional-effectiveness\u002Fassessment\u002Finstitutional-effectiveness-committee","items":[]},{"title":"York Assessment Management System (YAMS)","description":"","url":"\u002Finstitutional-effectiveness\u002Fassessment\u002Fyork-assessment-management-system-yams","items":[]}]},{"title":"Institutional Research","description":"Key institutional data","url":"\u002Finstitutional-effectiveness\u002Fdata","items":[{"title":"Common Data Set","description":"York College Common Data Set 2024-2025","url":"\u002Finstitutional-effectiveness\u002Fdata\u002Fcommon-data-set","items":[]},{"title":"Data Dashboards","description":"OIESP Academic Program Dashboards, CUNY Wage Dashboards, and U.S. Census Bureau Employment Dashboard","url":"\u002Finstitutional-effectiveness\u002Fdata\u002Fdata-dashboards","items":[]},{"title":"Enrollment Snapshots","description":"Fall student enrollment snapshots, including academic and demographic data for all enrolled students","url":"\u002Finstitutional-effectiveness\u002Fdata\u002Fkey-metrics","items":[]},{"title":"Factbook","description":"Produced annually, the factbook is organized into 15 sections with data including but not limited to enrollment, degrees granted, courses, retention and graduation, faculty, library, and finance","url":"\u002Finstitutional-effectiveness\u002Fdata\u002Ffactbook","items":[]},{"title":"Let's Talk Data!","description":"The Office of Institutional Effectiveness and Strategic Planning hosts the “Let’s Talk Data!” series. Each session focuses on a different topic, with time for Q&A. To register for a session, please click the appropriate link below.","url":"\u002Finstitutional-effectiveness\u002Fdata\u002Flets-talk-data-session","items":[]},{"title":"Research Briefs\u002FReports","description":"Three to ten page descriptions & analyses on specific research & assessment topics that align with the strategic plan. Briefs are published throughout the year to communicate assessment activities and promote data transparency at the College.","url":"\u002Finstitutional-effectiveness\u002Fdata\u002Fintranet","items":[]},{"title":"Student Success Outcomes","description":"Student Success Outcomes: One-year retention rates; Four-year and six-year graduation rates","url":"\u002Finstitutional-effectiveness\u002Fdata\u002Fstudent-outcomes","items":[]}]},{"title":"Planning","description":"One York Goals, Objectives, and Key Performance Indicators","url":"\u002Finstitutional-effectiveness\u002Fplanning","items":[{"title":"Strategic Planning Process, 2025-2026","description":"Materials documenting the strategic planning process","url":"\u002Finstitutional-effectiveness\u002Fplanning\u002Fstrategic-planning-process-2025-2026","items":[]},{"title":"One York Strategic Plan, 2020-2025","description":"One York 2020-2025 strategic plan, including key performance indicators and alignment with CUNY's \"Lifting New York\" plan. It details the planning process, committee, and meeting materials.","url":"\u002Finstitutional-effectiveness\u002Fplanning\u002Fone-york-strategic-plan-2020-2025","items":[]},{"title":"Annual Operational Plans and CUNY Performance Management Process","description":"Annual Operational Plans and Reports for the CUNY Performance Management Process (PMP)","url":"\u002Finstitutional-effectiveness\u002Fplanning\u002Fannual-operational-plan","items":[]},{"title":"Academic Master Planning Process","description":"","url":"\u002Finstitutional-effectiveness\u002Fplanning\u002Facademic-master-planning-process-1","items":[]}]},{"title":"Accreditation","description":"York College, CUNY is accredited by the Middle States Commission on Higher Education (MSCHE). In addition, some programs are also accredited by professional accreditation agencies. ","url":"\u002Finstitutional-effectiveness\u002Faccreditation","items":[{"title":"Institutional Accreditation","description":"York College is accredited by the Middle States Commission on Higher Education ","url":"\u002Finstitutional-effectiveness\u002Faccreditation\u002Finstitutional","items":[]},{"title":"Self-Study 2025-2027","description":"York College is currently engaged in the multi-year period of self-assessment and evaluation essential to our continued accreditation by the Middle States Commission on Higher Education. ","url":"\u002Finstitutional-effectiveness\u002Faccreditation\u002Fself-study","items":[]},{"title":"Accredited Academic Programs","description":"Academic programs at York College that hold accreditation from specialized professional accrediting agencies","url":"\u002Finstitutional-effectiveness\u002Faccreditation\u002Fprogram","items":[]}]},{"title":"Institutional Surveys","description":"York College Institutional Survey Results","url":"\u002Finstitutional-effectiveness\u002Fsurvey-results","items":[]},{"title":"Inquiries","description":"To request services from the Office of Institutional Effectiveness and Strategic Planning (OIESP), please complete the form below.","url":"\u002Finstitutional-effectiveness\u002Fservice-request","items":[]}],"loaded":true,"loading":false},"querystring":{"error":null,"indexes":{},"sortable_indexes":{},"loaded":false,"loading":false},"querystringsearch":{"error":null,"items":[],"total":0,"loaded":false,"loading":false,"batching":{},"subrequests":{}},"relations":{"relations":{"error":null,"loaded":false,"loading":false,"data":null},"stats":{"error":null,"loaded":false,"loading":false,"data":null},"create":{"error":null,"loaded":false,"loading":false},"delete":{"error":null,"loaded":false,"loading":false},"rebuild":{"error":null,"loaded":false,"loading":false},"subrequests":{}},"roles":{"error":null,"roles":[],"loaded":false,"loading":false},"rules":{"add":{"loaded":false,"loading":false,"error":null},"enable":{"loaded":false,"loading":false,"error":null},"disable":{"loaded":false,"loading":false,"error":null},"apply":{"loaded":false,"loading":false,"error":null},"unapply":{"loaded":false,"loading":false,"error":null},"remove":{"loaded":false,"loading":false,"error":null},"get":{"loaded":false,"loading":false,"error":null},"rules":[]},"controlpanelrule":{"get":{"loaded":false,"loading":false,"error":null},"delete":{"loaded":false,"loading":false,"error":null},"edit":{"loaded":false,"loading":false,"error":null},